          "value": "//Put the content of the selected field into a JSON object\nJSONObject json = new JSONObject(row3.dataset);\nString Query = \"\";\nString fieldName = \"\";\n//System.out.println(json.names());\n\n//Get the keys from the JSON Object and put them into a query\n//Do some generic fixes to the selected field names (replace values)\nfor (Object key : JSONObject.getNames(json)) {\n//    System.out.println(key);\n    fieldName = key.toString();\n    Query = Query +\"JSON_VALUE(dataset, '$.\\\"\"+fieldName+\"\\\"') as \"+fieldName.replace(\" \",\"_\").replace(\"-\",\"_\").replace(\"%\",\"\").replace(\" \",\"\").replace(\"(\",\"\").replace(\")\",\"\")+\", \";\n}\n\n//System.out.println(Query);\n//Put the end result into a global var\nglobalMap.put(\"QuerySelection\",Query);\n",
